WEBVTT

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:07.119
My Data lets you bring your own files onto the map, without uploading them anywhere.

00:00:07.953 --> 00:00:11.907
Click Upload data to open the My Data tab.

00:00:12.559 --> 00:00:23.537
Drag and drop a GeoTIFF, shapefile, KML, GeoJSON or CSV here. Nothing is sent to the internet.

00:00:24.199 --> 00:00:27.993
Or browse for a file with Add Local Data.

00:00:28.667 --> 00:00:35.006
Add Web Data connects a W M S or W F S service by its URL.

00:00:35.676 --> 00:00:38.875
Click Done to go back to the map.

00:00:39.530 --> 00:00:44.684
That is My Data. Your files stay in your browser.
